{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29138","headline":"闻州中有讌寄崔大夫兼简邢羣评事 · 许浑","name":"闻州中有讌寄崔大夫兼简邢羣评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箫管筵间列翠蛾，玉杯金液耀金波。\n池边雨过飘帷幕，海上风来动绮罗。\n颜子巷深青草遍，庾君楼迥碧山多。\n甘心不及同年友，卧听行云一曲歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}